<main><section class="page-hero"><div class="page-hero-content"><p class="section-label">PRIVACY & TRUST</p><h1>Privacy Notice</h1><p>Clear information about the data used by this academic demonstration website.</p></div></section><section class="narrow"><div class="card prose"><h2>What we collect</h2><p>Account registration collects your name, email address and a password hash. Enrolments record the selected course and user account. Contact forms store the name, email, subject and message needed to respond to enquiries.</p><h2>How data is used</h2><p>Data is used only to demonstrate authentication, course enrolment, dashboard functionality and enquiry handling for this project.</p><h2>How data is protected</h2><p>Passwords are stored using PHP password hashing. Database queries use prepared statements, forms use CSRF tokens, and authenticated areas use server-side sessions and role checks.</p><h2>Retention and deletion</h2><p>This is an academic demonstration system. Test data should be removed from the database when the project is no longer required.</p><h2>Third-party sharing</h2><p>No real user data is intentionally sold or shared with advertisers. Students should use test data during demonstrations.</p></div></section></main><?php site_footer(); ?>